        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Travelers research vacation packages across multiple online touchpoints before booking. Generic ads attract price-sensitive window-shoppers who demand endless quotes but never book. Specialized travel digital marketing targets high-intent travelers actively searching for specific destination packages, pre-qualifies their budget, and automates quotation delivery via WhatsApp."
