        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Can you generate leads for corporate MICE tours and destination weddings?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes! We run targeted LinkedIn and Meta B2B campaigns reaching corporate HR directors, event planners, and executive teams for annual corporate offsites, dealer incentive trips, and international group conferences."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do you improve booking conversion rates on sent travel quotations?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We build automated multi-stage WhatsApp drip campaigns that send detailed PDF itineraries, customer video reviews of that exact destination, limited-time flight discount countdowns, and quick 1-click callback links."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How does local SEO help a neighborhood travel agency?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "By optimizing your Google Business Profile, destination catalog posts, and local citations, we rank your agency in the top 3 Google Map pack results for searches like 'travel agent near me' and 'best tour operator in [city]'."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What is the average cost-per-lead (CPL) for holiday tour packages?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Cost per qualified lead typically ranges from ₹120 to ₹280 for popular domestic tours (Goa, Himachal, Kerala) and ₹320 to ₹750 for international destinations (Dubai, Thailand, Europe, Maldives), delivering an exceptional return on investment."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do you manage seasonal slumps between peak summer and winter holidays?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We diversify your campaign portfolio year-round with spiritual pilgrimage circuits (Char Dham, Ayodhya), weekend getaway staycations, monsoon trekking adventures, and early-bird discount booking promotions."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Do you design custom travel websites with itinerary download features?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes! We build high-speed, mobile-responsive travel portals featuring day-by-day interactive itinerary maps, transparent inclusions/exclusions lists, customer review widgets, and direct WhatsApp quote request buttons."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do you use Instagram Reels and video marketing for travel?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We produce viral destination highlight reels, local food guide videos, customer vacation reaction clips, and travel hacks that generate massive organic shares and inquiries from vacation planners."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do you handle negative online reviews caused by airline or hotel delays?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We deploy post-trip automated feedback workflows to capture 5-star Google and TripAdvisor reviews from delighted travelers while swiftly resolving grievances before public posting."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do you optimize travel agencies for AI search engines like ChatGPT and Gemini?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We implement structured TravelAgency, TouristTrip, and Offer schemas, publish comprehensive destination packing and visa guides, and build authoritative travel citations so AI assistants recommend your agency."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How fast can our travel marketing campaign launch?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Our travel marketing specialists can develop destination landing pages, qualification forms, ad creatives, and tracking setup to go live within 5 to 7 business days."
